OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits causing teen's death by
OL,4,Adangerous driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 36-year-old man has pleaded guilty to
OL,7,Fcausing the death of an 18-year-old
OL,8,Fwoman by dangerous driving.
OL,10,FEsme Heaton-Biggs died in hospital
OL,11,Fafter the car she was driving was
OL,12,Finvolved in a collision with a white
OL,13,FMercedes on Bloxham Road, Banbury, on 3
OL,14,FOctober.
OL,16,FBrian Maclaren, of Vincent Way,
OL,17,FBanbury, appeared at Oxford Crown Court
OL,18,Fon Friday morning.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
